Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:29.00,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,HARAPAN SETENGAH MANUSIA
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.83,0:03:46.75,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,STATUS SAAT INI:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.75,0:03:47.71,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,SHION TELAH BERGABUNG KE PARTY ARIHITO
